            "review_title": "Review at KISEKI-ro",
            "review_text": "KA\n20 contributions\n0\nUnique romantic experience\nMay 2024 • Couples\nI don’t even know where to start because I absolutely loved everything. This restaurant deserves a Michelin star. We were given a choice to eat privately or in the main dining room , we chose privately . The room was beautiful and romantic. We chose the 7 course tasting menu. We were given a complimentary glass of white wine which paired so wonderfully with our dishes that we ordered 2 more glasses . Each dish was delectable and was presented beautifully and the service was exceptional.\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2024",
