            "review_title": "Review at KISEKI-ro",
            "review_text": "Flyer41627118206\n4 contributions\n1\nFantastic food for people who appreciate something special.\nJan 2024 • Couples\nWe actually stumbled upon this great restaurant by chance. We were looking for a little something to eat.\n\nWhat we then experienced surprised us and was great!\n\nThe food was prepared right at our table. In lots of small, wonderfully tasty dishes.\n\nI can write a lot about that now... the best thing is for you to try it yourself.\n\nOf course, an eight-course meal like that isn't cheap, but it's definitely worth the price we paid!\n\nOur every wish was practically read from our eyes and implemented immediately. The service staff is super friendly and very customer-oriented.\n\nWhat we liked best was the young lady (whose name we unfortunately don't remember) who prepared the dishes for us at the table very professionally and with a lot of passion and dedication.\n\nA great restaurant in Hanoi, away from street food for people who appreciate something special.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 25, 2024",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
